---
description: Mandatory Flexge Design System and repository conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` and `src/design-system/README.md` before UI work.
Use the Flexge components from `@/src/design-system` and existing semantic
`--ds-*` tokens for every screen and prototype, including clones and forks.
Compose existing components; extend the shared core for reusable gaps. Keep
business logic in features and do not override core styling locally. The guide
defines the source hierarchy, stories, accessibility and validation workflow.
Follow `VERCEL.md` for publishing.
